		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Headless wraith clad in mail and rags. Haunts pathways and crossroads. Often mounted on a nightmare.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14 (chainmail), <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 longsword +5 (1d8) or curse, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Curse</strong>. One creature within near, WIS 15+ or cursed. Until dullahan is slain, DISADV on death saves.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
